# 4️⃣ CODE WISE PERFORMANCE STRATEGY

### ✅ requestAnimationFrame

For:

• Showing validation errors smoothly
• Avoid layout thrashing

Example:

```js
requestAnimationFrame(() => {
  setErrors(newErrors);
});
```

---

### ✅ Debounce (important for big forms)

For typing email:

```js
const debouncedValidate = debounce(validateEmail, 400);
```

👉 Avoid API spam

---

### ✅ Memoization

For expensive derived states:

```js
const visibleFields = useMemo(() => {
  return schema.fields.filter(f => !f.hidden);
}, [schema, values]);
```

---

### ✅ Caching

Cache dropdown data:

```js
const cache = new Map();

if (cache.has(url)) return cache.get(url);
```

---

### ✅ useCallback

Avoid rerender storm on large forms:

```js
const handleChange = useCallback((id, value) => {
  dispatch({ id, value });
}, []);
```

