# 6️⃣ PAGINATION + LOADER + INTERSECTION OBSERVER

### For huge dropdown lists:

Instead of loading 10k countries 👇

Use:

✅ Infinite scroll

```js
const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
  if (entries[0].isIntersecting) {
    loadNextPage();
  }
});
```

---

### Loader States:

• Field-level loader (loading states)
• Form-level loader (submit)

